                                                                                
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*        
*                                                                      *        
*  PROGRAM    :  W1523000                                              *        
*                                                                      *        
*  FUNCTION   :  THIS PROGRAM CREATES A COMMA-SEPARATED-VALUES FILE    *        
*                WHICH COMPRISES ALL VCCS PARTS CREATED DESCRIPTIONS   *        
*                SINCE LAST RUN. (WEEKLY)                              *        
*                                                                      *        
*                THE RUN DATE IS SAVED IN A FILE AND READ AT THE NEXT  *        
*                RUN TO DETERMINE START-DATE FOR THE DATA RANGE.       *        
*                                                                      *        
*  MISSION    :  ETRACKER = 2921916                                    *        
*                                                                      *        
*  CREATED BY :  EGHOLT CONNY                                          *        
*                                                                      *        
*  DATE       :  2006-03-03                                            *        
*                                                                      *        
*  CHANGES    :  2006-06-19  IDBENNR-KY IS 2 BYTES LONGER.             *        
*                                                                      *        
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*        
                                                                                
NEWPAGE                                                                         
FILE W15230D1                                                                   
%WCDCPART  'CDC-'                                                               
*                                                                               
                                                                                
NEWPAGE                                                                         
FILE W15230D2                                                                   
* THIS FILE IS CREATED IN PREVIOUS JOB                                          
 XTR-FILE               1  8188  A                                              
*                                                                               
 XTR-IDSEGMENT          1     6  A                                              
 XTR-FILLER1            7     2  A                                              
 XTR-IDBENNR-KY         9     4  P  0                                           
 XTR-FILLER2           13    34  A                                              
                                                                                
 XTR-WDD301            47    14  A                                              
 XTR-WDD301-IDBENNR    47     4  P 0                                            
 XTR-WDD301-KDBENSTAT  56     1  P 0                                            
                                                                                
 XTR-WDD311            47   120  A                                              
 XTR-WDD311-IDSKYLT    47     3  A                                              
 XTR-WDD311-BEART      50    25  A                                              
 XTR-WDD311-TIUPPDAT  151     4  P 0                                            
                                                                                
 XTR-WDD312            47     6  A                                              
 XTR-WDD312-IDARTNR    47     5  P 0                                            
*                                                                               
*                                                                               
                                                                                
NEWPAGE                                                                         
FILE W15230D3                                                                   
 IDAT-TIAAAAMMDD  1   8  N                                                      
 IDAT-FILLER      9   3  A                                                      
                                                                                
                                                                                
NEWPAGE                                                                         
FILE W15230D4 FB(11 0)                                                          
 UDAT-TIAAAAMMDD  1   8  N                                                      
 UDAT-FILLER      9   3  A                                                      
*                                                                               
                                                                                
NEWPAGE                                                                         
FILE W15230D5 VB(121 0)                                                         
* Samma recordlängd som rubrikarean  UTR-.  D&P kräver VB                       
UT1-IDARTNR     1   8   N                                                       
UT1-S1          9   1   A                                                       
UT1-KDPRODSL   10   2   N                                                       
UT1-S2         12   1   A                                                       
UT1-IDBENNR    13   7   N                                                       
UT1-S3         20   1   A                                                       
UT1-BEART-SVE  21  25   A                                                       
UT1-S4         46   1   A                                                       
UT1-BEART-ENG  47  25   A                                                       
UT1-S5         72   1   A                                                       
UT1-TIUPPDAT   73   8   N                                                       
UT1-SEKEL UT1-TIUPPDAT    3 N                                                   
UT1-S6         81   1   A                                                       
UT1-KDSORT     82   2   A                                                       
UT1-S7         84   1   A                                                       
UT1-KDERS      85   2   N                                                       
UT1-S8         87   1   A                                                       
UT1-IDBERED    88   3   N                                                       
UT1-S9         91   1   A                                                       
*                                                                               
*                                                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
FILE RUBRIKER VB(121 0) VIRTUAL                                                 
*                                                                               
UTR-AREA            1 117 A                                                     
                                                                                
  UTR-IDARTNR       1 10 A                                                      
  UTR-S1           11 1  A                                                      
  UTR-KDPRODSL     12 8  A                                                      
  UTR-S2           20 1  A                                                      
  UTR-IDBENNR      21 8  A                                                      
  UTR-S3           29 1  A                                                      
  UTR-BEART-SVE    30 25 A                                                      
  UTR-S4           55 1  A                                                      
  UTR-BEART-ENG    56 25 A                                                      
  UTR-S5           81 1  A                                                      
  UTR-TIUPPDAT     82 8  A                                                      
  UTR-S6           90 1  A                                                      
  UTR-KDSORT       91 9   A                                                     
  UTR-S7           100 1  A                                                     
  UTR-KDERS        101 8  A                                                     
  UTR-S8           109 1  A                                                     
  UTR-IDBERED      110 7  A                                                     
  UTR-S9           117 1  A                                                     
*                                                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
FILE TOMRAD VB(121 0) VIRTUAL                                                   
*                                                                               
  TOM-AREA    1  121 A                                                          
  TOM-D1      1  10  A                                                          
  TOM-S1      11  1  A                                                          
  TOM-D2      12 10  A                                                          
  TOM-S2      22  1  A                                                          
  TOM-D3      23 10  A                                                          
  TOM-S3      33  1  A                                                          
  TOM-D4      34 10  A                                                          
  TOM-S4      44  1  A                                                          
  TOM-D5      45 10  A                                                          
  TOM-S5      55  1  A                                                          
  TOM-D6      56 10  A                                                          
  TOM-S6      66  1  A                                                          
  TOM-D7      67 10  A                                                          
  TOM-S7      77  1  A                                                          
  TOM-D8      78 10  A                                                          
  TOM-S8      88  1  A                                                          
  TOM-D9      89 10  A                                                          
  TOM-S9      99  1  A                                                          
*                                                                               
*                                                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
FILE WDD3DTA   FB(64 0) VIRTUAL                                                 
*                                                                               
TMP-IDARTNR      1   5  P 0                                                     
TMP-IDBENNR      6   4  P 0                                                     
TMP-KDBENSTAT   10   1  P 0                                                     
TMP-TIUPPDAT    11   4  P 0                                                     
TMP-BEART-SVE   15  25  A                                                       
TMP-BEART-ENG   40  25  A                                                       
*                                                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*****************************************************************               
*                                                               *               
* ARBETSAREA                                                    *               
*                                                               *               
*****************************************************************               
                                                                                
DATUM1                  W   8   A                                               
AA1     DATUM1              2   A                                               
MM1     DATUM1         +3   2   A                                               
DD1     DATUM1         +6   2   A                                               
                                                                                
DATUM2                  W   6   A                                               
AA2     DATUM2              2   A                                               
MM2     DATUM2         +2   2   A                                               
DD2     DATUM2         +4   2   A                                               
DAGENSDATUM   DATUM2        6   N                                               
                                                                                
*                                                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*                                                                               
  WS-TREFF     W   1   A                                                        
  WS-ART       W   1   A                                                        
  WS-START-DAT W   6   N                                                        
  WS-STOPP-DAT W   6   N                                                        
*                                                                               
  WS-DISP                  W 25 A                                               
    WS-START-RED WS-DISP      8 N                                               
    WS-TO        WS-DISP  +10 5 A  VALUE 'to '                                  
    WS-STOPP-RED WS-DISP  +14 8 N                                               
     SEKEL WS-STOPP-RED       2 N                                               
*                                                                               
  WS-LISTPOSTER-FINNS  W 1 A                                                    
*                                                                               
%WWPRODSL  'CDC-' WORK ''                                                       
*                                                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*                                                                               
**********************************************                                  
* STEG 1.                                    *                                  
* SELEKTERA POSTER UR WDD3-EXTRAKTET         *                                  
**********************************************                                  
*                                                                               
JOB INPUT W15230D2  START A-DATE                                                
                                                                                
   IF XTR-IDSEGMENT = 'WDD301'                                                  
     WS-TREFF  = 'N'                                                            
     WS-ART    = 'N'                                                            
     IF XTR-WDD301-KDBENSTAT = +0                                               
        TMP-IDBENNR   = XTR-WDD301-IDBENNR                                      
        TMP-KDBENSTAT = XTR-WDD301-KDBENSTAT                                    
     END-IF                                                                     
   END-IF                                                                       
                                                                                
   IF XTR-IDSEGMENT = 'WDD311'                                                  
     IF XTR-IDBENNR-KY = TMP-IDBENNR                                            
*      --- Det är fortfarande under samma rot                                   
       IF XTR-WDD311-IDSKYLT = 'GB '                                            
                                                                                
         IF     XTR-WDD311-TIUPPDAT >  WS-START-DAT  +                          
         AND    XTR-WDD311-TIUPPDAT <= WS-STOPP-DAT                             
             WS-TREFF = 'J'                                                     
             TMP-TIUPPDAT  = XTR-WDD311-TIUPPDAT                                
             TMP-BEART-ENG = XTR-WDD311-BEART                                   
         ELSE                                                                   
             WS-TREFF = 'N'                                                     
             TMP-BEART-ENG = ' '                                                
         END-IF                                                                 
       END-IF                                                                   
       IF XTR-WDD311-IDSKYLT = 'S  '                                            
         IF     XTR-WDD311-TIUPPDAT >  WS-START-DAT  +                          
         AND    XTR-WDD311-TIUPPDAT <= WS-STOPP-DAT                             
             WS-TREFF = 'J'                                                     
             TMP-TIUPPDAT  = XTR-WDD311-TIUPPDAT                                
             TMP-BEART-SVE = XTR-WDD311-BEART                                   
         ELSE                                                                   
             WS-TREFF = 'N'                                                     
             TMP-BEART-SVE = ' '                                                
         END-IF                                                                 
       END-IF                                                                   
     END-IF                                                                     
   END-IF                                                                       
                                                                                
   IF XTR-IDSEGMENT = 'WDD312'                                                  
     IF  XTR-IDBENNR-KY = TMP-IDBENNR                   +                       
     AND WS-TREFF  = 'J'                                                        
*      --- Det är fortfarande under samma rot                                   
       TMP-IDARTNR = XTR-WDD312-IDARTNR                                         
       PUT WDD3DTA                                                              
       WS-ART = 'J'                                                             
     END-IF                                                                     
   END-IF                                                                       
*                                                                               
*                                                                               
*                                                                               
*                                                                               
A-DATE.  PROC                                                                   
   DATUM1 = SYSDATE                                                             
   AA2 = AA1                                                                    
   MM2 = MM1                                                                    
   DD2 = DD1                                                                    
   WS-STOPP-DAT = DAGENSDATUM                                                   
   WS-STOPP-RED = DAGENSDATUM                                                   
   SEKEL        = 20                                                            
*                                                                               
*            GET PREVIOUS RUN-DATE                                              
   GET W15230D3                                                                 
*                                                                               
   WS-START-DAT  = IDAT-TIAAAAMMDD                                              
   WS-START-RED  = IDAT-TIAAAAMMDD                                              
*                                                                               
   UDAT-TIAAAAMMDD = WS-STOPP-RED                                               
   UDAT-FILLER   = '   '                                                        
*         SAVE TODAYS RUN-DATE (WS-STOPP-DAT)                                   
   PUT W15230D4                                                                 
*                                                                               
*                                                                               
   DISPLAY 'START ' WS-START-DAT                                                
   DISPLAY 'STOPP ' WS-STOPP-DAT                                                
   DISPLAY 'UDAT-TIAAMMDD ' WS-STOPP-RED                                        
END-PROC                                                                        
*                                                                               
*                                                                               
*                                                                               
*                                                                               
*                                                                               
*                                                                               
**********************************************                                  
* STEG 2                                     *                                  
* SORTERA WDD3DTA PÅ ARTIKELNUMMER           *                                  
**********************************************                                  
SORT WDD3DTA TO WDD3DTA USING (TMP-IDARTNR, TMP-IDBENNR)                        
*                                                                               
*                                                                               
*                                                                               
*                                                                               
*                                                                               
****************************************************                            
* STEG 3                                           *                            
* MATCHA W15230D1 MED SELEKTERADE POSTER I WDD3DTA *                            
****************************************************                            
*                                                                               
JOB INPUT ( W15230D1 KEY(CDC-IDARTNR)          +                                
            WDD3DTA KEY(TMP-IDARTNR) )        +                                 
START A-INIT +                                                                  
FINISH Z-FINIT                                                                  
                                                                                
   IF MATCHED                                                                   
     PERFORM S25-CHECK-CDC-KDPRODSL                                             
     IF CDC-KDPRODSL = KDPRODSL-PARTS-CHEM KDPRODSL-ACC                         
        UT1-IDARTNR = TMP-IDARTNR                                               
        UT1-KDPRODSL = CDC-KDPRODSL                                             
        UT1-IDBENNR = TMP-IDBENNR                                               
        UT1-BEART-SVE = CDC-BEART-SVE                                           
        UT1-BEART-ENG = CDC-BEART-ENG                                           
        UT1-TIUPPDAT = TMP-TIUPPDAT                                             
*       UT1-SEKEL    = 20                                                       
        UT1-KDSORT    = CDC-KDSORT                                              
        UT1-KDERS     = CDC-KDERS                                               
        UT1-IDBERED   = CDC-IDBERED                                             
                                                                                
        WS-LISTPOSTER-FINNS = 'J'                                               
        PUT W15230D5                                                            
     END-IF                                                                     
   ELSE                                                                         
     IF WDD3DTA                                                                 
       IF TMP-IDARTNR   = 00000000                                              
          UT1-IDARTNR   = TMP-IDARTNR                                           
          UT1-KDPRODSL  = 00                                                    
          UT1-IDBENNR   = TMP-IDBENNR                                           
          UT1-BEART-SVE = TMP-BEART-SVE                                         
          UT1-BEART-ENG = TMP-BEART-ENG                                         
*         UT1-TIUPPDAT  = TMP-TIUPPDAT                                          
          UT1-SEKEL     = 20                                                    
          UT1-KDSORT  = ' '                                                     
          UT1-KDERS   = 0                                                       
          UT1-IDBERED = 0                                                       
                                                                                
          WS-LISTPOSTER-FINNS = 'J'                                             
          PUT W15230D5                                                          
       END-IF                                                                   
     END-IF                                                                     
   END-IF                                                                       
*                                                                               
                                                                                
A-INIT. PROC                                                                    
****************************************************                            
* SKAPA RUBRIKRADER och KOLUMN-MARKERINGAR         *                            
****************************************************                            
        UT1-S1 = ';'                                                            
        UT1-S2 = ';'                                                            
        UT1-S3 = ';'                                                            
        UT1-S4 = ';'                                                            
        UT1-S5 = ';'                                                            
        UT1-S6 = ';'                                                            
        UT1-S7 = ';'                                                            
        UT1-S8 = ';'                                                            
        UT1-S9 = ';'                                                            
                                                                                
        UTR-S1 = ';'                                                            
        UTR-S2 = ';'                                                            
        UTR-S3 = ';'                                                            
        UTR-S4 = ';'                                                            
        UTR-S5 = ';'                                                            
        UTR-S6 = ';'                                                            
        UTR-S7 = ';'                                                            
        UTR-S8 = ';'                                                            
        UTR-S9 = ';'                                                            
                                                                                
        UTR-IDARTNR   = 'W15230-001'                                            
        UTR-KDPRODSL  = '        '                                              
        UTR-IDBENNR   = 'Interval'                                              
        UTR-BEART-SVE = WS-DISP                                                 
        UTR-BEART-ENG = 'Routine W152V1'                                        
        UTR-TIUPPDAT  = 'PULS   '                                               
        UTR-KDSORT    = '         '                                             
        UTR-KDERS     = '        '                                              
        UTR-IDBERED   = '       '                                               
                                                                                
        PUT RUBRIKER                                                            
        PUT W15230D5 FROM RUBRIKER                                              
                                                                                
        TOM-AREA = ' '                                                          
        TOM-S1 = ';'                                                            
        TOM-S2 = ';'                                                            
        TOM-S3 = ';'                                                            
        TOM-S4 = ';'                                                            
        TOM-S5 = ';'                                                            
        TOM-S6 = ';'                                                            
        TOM-S7 = ';'                                                            
        TOM-S8 = ';'                                                            
        TOM-S9 = ';'                                                            
                                                                                
        PUT TOMRAD                                                              
        PUT W15230D5 FROM TOMRAD                                                
                                                                                
        UTR-KDPRODSL  = 'Prod.Grp'                                              
        UTR-IDARTNR   = 'PartNo.'                                               
        UTR-IDBENNR   = 'Descr.ID'                                              
        UTR-BEART-SVE = 'SWE Description'                                       
        UTR-BEART-ENG = 'ENG Description'                                       
        UTR-TIUPPDAT  = 'Updated'                                               
        UTR-KDSORT    = 'Sort code'                                             
        UTR-KDERS     = 'Sup.code'                                              
        UTR-IDBERED   = 'Planner'                                               
                                                                                
        PUT RUBRIKER                                                            
        PUT W15230D5 FROM RUBRIKER                                              
*                                                                               
        WS-LISTPOSTER-FINNS = 'N'                                               
END-PROC                                                                        
*                                                                               
Z-FINIT. PROC                                                                   
****************************************************                            
* SKAPA EV. RAD MED INFO OM TOMT INNEHÅLL          *                            
****************************************************                            
   IF WS-LISTPOSTER-FINNS = 'N'                                                 
     UT1-BEART-SVE = 'NO NEW DESCRIPTIONS      '                                
     PUT W15230D5                                                               
   END-IF                                                                       
END-PROC                                                                        
*                                                                               
%WWPRODSL 'CDC-' PROC ''                                                        
*                                                                               
